#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Mitigation is a package for handling noise in quantum computations. "
"It contains a set of techniques that can be used to build advanced or "
"customized error mitigation pipelines directly with "
"[samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Specifically, it "
"contains:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Implementations of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout "
"Error eXtinction (TREX), and Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) with "
"Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) and gate folding amplification "
"methods.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Functionality for computing a postselected noise channel, from circuit "
"symmetries or spacetime checks, to be used with PEC to reduce sampling "
"overhead [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Postselection using non-Markovian error checks to filter corrupted samples "
"out of measured data.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for expectation value calculation with advanced error mitigation.\n"
msgstr ""

